! wB97X-D3 6-31G* TightSCF
# TDX barrel-2 QM region in vacuum: does it absorb anywhere near 515 nm?
# Matched to the production pipeline's functional/basis and TDA, so the two
# site energies are on the same footing. Vacuum, not embedded: an embedding
# field moves a transition by ~0.1-0.3 eV, not by the ~2 eV that would be
# needed to bring a tyrosine into the visible.
%pal nprocs 4 end
%maxcore 2000
%tddft
  nroots 12
  tda true
end
* xyzfile 0 1 darkbarrel.xyz
